    "title": "Speaking and interaction practice",
    "subtitle": "A description needs precision · 8 · preparation 1",
    "context": "Use this subset of the reference vocabulary and constructions in a short self-contained situation, preparing for U3-26. Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to identify an entity from a description and repair a mistaken interpretation.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U3-26-P01-speak-produce",
